<title>THAILAND: Thailand to host ASEAN finance ministers' meeting.</title>
<headline>Thailand to host ASEAN finance ministers' meeting.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand will host a meeting of ASEAN Finance Ministers to boost cooperation within the seven-member grouping from November 21-23, a Finance Ministry official said on Friday.</p>
<p>The Association of Southeast Asian Nations (ASEAN) groups Brunei, Indonesia, Malaysia, the Philippines, Singapore, Thailand and Vietnam.</p>
<p>&quot;The main topic at the meeting will be the liberalisation of the financial sector and cooperation in monetary and banking policy among member countries,&quot; Somchai Richupan, director general of the Fiscal Policy Office, told reporters.</p>
<p>The venue for the meeting has not been decided and he gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
